---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section id="storia" class="scroll-mt-28 overflow-hidden py-24 md:py-32">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 md:px-8">
		<div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10 lg:items-start">
			<div class="lg:col-span-5" data-animate>
				<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#18b24b]">Chi siamo</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-balance text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#2c2c2c] md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem]">
					Nati dalla passione per la natura e la mobilità elettrica
				</h2>
				<div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2c2c2c]/88">
					<p>
						Valsesia Electric Green nasce 4 anni fa dall’interesse per la mobilità elettrica e l’ecosostenibilità. Siamo
						specializzati in escursioni guidate in moto elettrica nelle zone naturalistiche del Piemonte e della
						Lombardia.
					</p>
					<p>
						Offriamo un’attività a 360°: noleggio, tour, vendita, assistenza e officina mobile — così puoi
						affidarti a un solo interlocutore per tutto il percorso.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="relative lg:col-span-7" data-animate>
				<div
					class="absolute -left-3 -top-3 z-10 flex h-20 w-20 flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#18b24b] text-white shadow-xl shadow-[#18b24b]/30 md:-left-6 md:-top-6 md:h-28 md:w-28"
				>
					<span class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-none md:text-3xl">4</span>
					<span class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest md:mt-1 md:text-[10px]">anni</span>
				</div>
				<figure class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl shadow-black/20 ring-1 ring-black/5">
					<img
						src="/images/image-storia.jpg"
						alt="Rider in azione su pista sterrata — passione per due ruote e outdoor"
						class="aspect-[3/2] w-full object-cover"
						loading="lazy"
						width="4000"
						height="2667"
					/>
					<div
						class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/55 via-black/10 to-transparent"
						aria-hidden="true"
					>
					</div>
					<figcaption
						class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-10 w-full border-t border-white/35 bg-white/[0.08] shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.22)] backdrop-blur-2xl backdrop-saturate-150"
					>
						<div
							class="flex w-full min-w-0 items-stretch gap-2 px-3 py-3 sm:gap-4 sm:px-5 sm:py-5 md:gap-6 md:px-9 md:py-7"
						>
							<div class="w-1 shrink-0 self-stretch rounded-full bg-[#18b24b] sm:w-1.5" aria-hidden="true"></div>
							<div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-start gap-2 sm:gap-3.5 md:gap-4">
								<span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#7ddf9e]" aria-hidden="true">
									<Icon name="badge-check" class="h-5 w-5 sm:h-6 sm:w-6 md:h-7 md:w-7" />
								</span>
								<div class="min-w-0">
									<p
										class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-200/95 sm:text-[10px] sm:tracking-[0.2em]"
									>
										Partner ufficiale
									</p>
									<p
										class="mt-1 text-base font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:mt-1.5 sm:text-xl md:text-2xl"
									>
										Talaria Italia
									</p>
									<p
										class="mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 text-xs leading-snug text-white/86 sm:mt-2 sm:line-clamp-none sm:text-sm sm:leading-relaxed md:text-[0.9375rem]"
									>
										Qualità e assistenza certificata sui nostri servizi e sulle moto.
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
